# Generated reports stay local except the submission samples and the summary CSV.
# (Git cannot re-include a file inside an ignored directory, so ignore contents with
# "/*" and re-include the run folder before re-including individual files.)
reports/*
!reports/2026-10-29/
reports/2026-10-29/*
!reports/2026-10-29/AAPL_report.ipynb
!reports/2026-10-29/IBM_report.ipynb
!reports/2026-10-29/NKE_report.ipynb
